WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:05.169
- [Voiceover] Jayden.

00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:06.582
- Huh?

00:00:14.347 --> 00:00:15.831
- [Voiceover] Who made the mess?

00:00:15.846 --> 00:00:16.895
(child mumbles)

00:00:16.895 --> 00:00:17.991
- [Voiceover] Billy did?

00:00:18.899 --> 00:00:20.475
Come here, I wanna talk to you.

00:00:22.731 --> 00:00:24.858
- [Voiceover] Where you
throwing stuff over the side?

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:25.987
(child mumbles)

00:00:29.354 --> 00:00:30.547
- [Voiceover] Nice!

00:00:31.097 --> 00:00:33.055
- [Voiceover] It's sugar,
you know that right?

00:00:33.055 --> 00:00:34.522
(child laughs)

00:00:35.091 --> 00:00:39.051
- [Voiceover] Justin! What are ya doing?

00:00:39.051 --> 00:00:41.519
- [Voiceover] Mommy's gonna be very upset.

00:00:41.519 --> 00:00:42.749
- [Child] At me?

00:00:42.749 --> 00:00:43.930
- [Voiceover] Yeah, at you.

00:00:43.930 --> 00:00:45.234
Look what you guys did!

00:00:46.081 --> 00:00:47.677
- [Voiceover] Ally, what did you do?

00:00:49.297 --> 00:00:51.201
- [Voiceover] What did you guys do?

00:00:51.201 --> 00:00:53.221
- [Child] I didn't do anything.

00:00:53.221 --> 00:00:54.593
I didn't do it.

00:00:54.593 --> 00:00:56.844
- [Voiceover] Why did you
let her do that to you?

00:00:56.844 --> 00:00:58.005
- I didn't see her.

00:00:58.005 --> 00:00:59.605
- [Voiceover] You... (laughs)

00:01:00.222 --> 00:01:01.823
- [Voiceover] What are you doing?

00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:03.823
Huh?

00:01:04.878 --> 00:01:06.954
- [Voiceover] Hayden,
what happened to you?

00:01:06.954 --> 00:01:08.185
What were you doing?

00:01:09.256 --> 00:01:10.107
- I don't--

00:01:10.107 --> 00:01:11.280
- [Voiceover] You don't know?

00:01:14.781 --> 00:01:17.343
- [Voiceover] What are you doing?

00:01:17.343 --> 00:01:18.412
- [Child] Playing with the toilet.

00:01:18.412 --> 00:01:19.996
- [Voiceover] What are
you doing to Addison?

00:01:19.996 --> 00:01:22.035
- Uuuh...

00:01:22.035 --> 00:01:23.534
- [Voiceover] Uh uh.

00:01:25.288 --> 00:01:27.650
What did you do with
your stickers, Brayden?

00:01:27.650 --> 00:01:29.665
(Brayden cries in response)

00:01:31.884 --> 00:01:35.660
(upbeat playful music)

